                            <comment id="13485854" author="phunt" created="Mon, 29 Oct 2012 06:27:59 +0000"  >&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;In patch v8, I don&apos;t see special handling for cnxn.getXid()&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

